---
title: Seared Salmon
servings: 4
course: Main
locale: en
difficulty: Medium
cuisine: Singaporean
---

Mix the @Madras curry powder, medium{2%tsp}, @salt{0.25%tsp}, and @sugar{1%tsp} in a wide, shallow dish. Dredge the @salmon fillets{4}(200 g each) in the rub, turning the pieces all over.

Heat @garlic oil{15%ml} in a heavy-based pan and cook the salmon fillets on a high heat for about 2 to ~{3%minutes} a side, searing the sides of the fillets if they are very thick. Serve with @./Savoury/Singapore Noodles v1{}.